{
	"$schema": "http://127.0.0.1:5186/schema/registry-item.json",
	"name": "aspect-ratio",
	"title": "Aspect Ratio 宽高比",
	"type": "registry:ui",
	"description": "让内容按固定宽高比显示。",
	"devDependencies": [
		"bits-ui@2.20.0",
		"@internationalized/date@^3.12.0"
	],
	"meta": {
		"valar": {
			"keywords": [
				"宽高比",
				"aspect ratio",
				"比例",
				"图片容器",
				"16:9"
			],
			"whenToUse": [
				"图片、视频、地图按固定比例占位，避免加载时布局跳动"
			],
			"whenNotToUse": [
				{
					"case": "用户头像",
					"use": "avatar"
				},
				{
					"case": "一组可滑动浏览的图片",
					"use": "carousel"
				}
			],
			"accessibility": [
				"内部图片要写 alt 文字"
			],
			"responsive": [
				"宽度随容器变化，高度按 ratio 计算"
			],
			"related": [
				"avatar",
				"carousel",
				"card"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Aspect Ratio 设计规范\n\n- 用 `ratio` 属性（如 `ratio={16 / 9}`）固定媒体的宽高比，不要用 padding 技巧或固定高度。\n- 内部的图片、视频设 `size-full object-cover`（需要完整显示时用 `object-contain`），图片要有 `alt`（检查规则 `valar/image-alt`）。\n- Issue 正文和其他需完整显示的媒体可用 `appearance=\"media\"`。提供媒体比例和目标显示宽度 `mediaWidth`，按可用宽度和 600 px 高度上限等比缩小。媒体用 6 px 圆角和 `object-contain`。需要实际播放时由视频控件提供键盘操作。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "aspect-ratio/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { AspectRatio as AspectRatioPrimitive } from \"bits-ui\";\n\timport { cn } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tratio = 1,\n\t\tappearance = \"default\",\n\t\tmediaWidth,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: AspectRatioPrimitive.RootProps & {\n\t\tappearance?: \"default\" | \"media\";\n\t\t/** Preferred display width in pixels. The container and media height limit can reduce it. */\n\t\tmediaWidth?: number;\n\t} = $props();\n\n\tconst media = $derived(appearance === \"media\");\n\tconst mediaRatio = $derived(Number.isFinite(ratio) && ratio > 0 ? ratio : 1);\n\tconst maxMediaWidth = $derived(\n\t\tMath.min(\n\t\t\tmediaWidth !== undefined && Number.isFinite(mediaWidth) && mediaWidth > 0\n\t\t\t\t? mediaWidth\n\t\t\t\t: Infinity,\n\t\t\t600 * mediaRatio\n\t\t)\n\t);\n</script>\n\n{#snippet frame()}\n\t<AspectRatioPrimitive.Root\n\t\tbind:ref\n\t\tratio={media ? mediaRatio : ratio}\n\t\tdata-slot=\"aspect-ratio\"\n\t\tdata-appearance={media ? \"media\" : undefined}\n\t\tclass={cn(className)}\n\t\t{...restProps}\n\t/>\n{/snippet}\n\n{#if media}\n\t<div\n\t\tclass=\"w-full min-w-0 [&_[data-slot=aspect-ratio]]:overflow-hidden [&_[data-slot=aspect-ratio]]:rounded-[6px] [&_:is(img,video)]:size-full [&_:is(img,video)]:object-contain\"\n\t\tstyle:max-width={`${maxMediaWidth}px`}\n\t>\n\t\t{@render frame()}\n\t</div>\n{:else}\n\t{@render frame()}\n{/if}\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "aspect-ratio/aspect-ratio.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "import Root from \"./aspect-ratio.svelte\";\n\nexport { Root, Root as AspectRatio };\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "aspect-ratio/index.ts"
		}
	]
}